  "sources": {
    "siteClasses": "NZS 1170.5 3.1.3 (classes A-E) and Table 3.1 Ch(T): A and B 1.0 + 13.5 T to 0.1 s, 2.35 to 0.3 s, 1.60 (0.5/T)^0.75 to 1.5 s, 1.05/T to 3 s, 3.15/T²; C 1.33 + 16.0 T, 2.93, 2.0 (0.5/T)^0.75, 1.32/T, 3.96/T²; D 1.12 + 18.8 T, 3.0 to 0.56 s, 2.4 (0.75/T)^0.75, 2.14/T, 6.42/T²; E 1.12 + 18.8 T, 3.0 to 1.0 s, 3.0/T^0.75, 3.32/T, 9.96/T²; the equivalent static method takes the plateau below 0.1 s (the table's bracketed values, staticPlateau); S = Ch(0)",
